The handler sees raw dot/apostrophe spelling and quoted/escaped arguments.
Generated .TH remains the fallback. Token formatting is separate from source.
-- options.json --
{"package":"man","handlers":["local"]}
-- input.1 --
.LOCAL "héllo world"
'LOCAL second\ word
.TH TOOL 1
-- expected.txt --
.CUSTOM man "héllo world" | .LOCAL "héllo world"
.CUSTOM man second\ word | 'LOCAL second\ word
.TH TOOL 1 | .TH TOOL 1
-- extract.txt --
héllo world
second word
TOOL 1
